## Family Privacy Notice

This software is designed to be self-hosted by families to maintain complete
control over their personal data. No data is shared with third parties unless
explicitly configured by the family administrators.

Key Privacy Features:
- All data stays within your family's control
- Self-hosted deployment options
- No external tracking or analytics by default
- Family-first design with privacy as a core principle
- Optional integrations require explicit consent

For families using this software: Please review all integrations and ensure
they align with your family's privacy preferences before enabling them. 